1
00:00:49,700 --> 00:00:51,140
Why did you come alone?

2
00:00:51,660 --> 00:00:52,660
Where is Yaya?

3
00:00:52,820 --> 00:00:54,020
She's busy with work.

4
00:00:54,260 --> 00:00:56,000
I bought you some food. It's in the kitchen. Remember to eat it.

5
00:00:56,000 --> 00:00:57,600
Take it away. I don't want it.

6
00:00:58,440 --> 00:00:59,900
Bring Yaya back to me.

7
00:01:02,040 --> 00:01:03,170
She won't come back.

8
00:01:03,400 --> 00:01:04,739
She's living a good life now.

9
00:01:04,739 --> 00:01:06,460
You don't need to worry about her.

10
00:01:06,460 --> 00:01:07,380
Damn girl.

11
00:01:07,820 --> 00:01:10,280
She would have a good life living with me too.

12
00:01:10,800 --> 00:01:13,060
You're exactly like your dead mother.

13
00:01:14,240 --> 00:01:16,060
Hurry up and bring Yaya back to me.

14
00:01:16,060 --> 00:01:17,920
I only have one daughter left now.

15
00:01:18,039 --> 00:01:19,300
She needs to live with me.

16
00:01:19,300 --> 00:01:20,940
Why do you think we left you?

17
00:01:21,660 --> 00:01:24,000
To pay off your gambling debts.

18
00:01:26,660 --> 00:01:28,740
We're already living a hard life.

19
00:01:30,440 --> 00:01:34,039
When have you ever fulfilled your responsibilities as a father?

20
00:01:37,000 --> 00:01:37,800
Leave.

21
00:01:45,940 --> 00:01:48,039
It doesn't matter how you torture me.

22
00:01:49,400 --> 00:01:51,140
I won't give Xiaoya back to you.

23
00:01:55,460 --> 00:01:57,940
I've already transferred this month's money to you.

24
00:01:57,940 --> 00:01:59,740
Damn girl. Get out.

25
00:01:59,740 --> 00:02:01,840
Get out. Get out of here.

26
00:02:04,100 --> 00:02:05,300
Pay me back the money.

27
00:02:06,700 --> 00:02:07,900
Open the door.

28
00:02:08,539 --> 00:02:09,340
Hurry up.

29
00:02:10,100 --> 00:02:10,900
Sis.

30
00:02:11,000 --> 00:02:12,460
What should we do?

31
00:02:12,460 --> 00:02:13,920
Hurry up and open the door.

32
00:02:13,940 --> 00:02:15,000
I know you're inside.

33
00:02:15,000 --> 00:02:15,930
Don't be afraid.

34
00:02:16,540 --> 00:02:17,540
Open the door now.

35
00:02:19,000 --> 00:02:19,940
Hurry up.

36
00:02:23,440 --> 00:02:23,860
Money.

37
00:02:23,860 --> 00:02:24,500
Hurry up and open it.

38
00:02:24,500 --> 00:02:26,100
I will figure something out.

39
00:02:26,700 --> 00:02:29,100
Pay back the money. Hurry up.

40
00:03:16,400 --> 00:03:17,200
Lawyer Gu.

41
00:03:19,000 --> 00:03:21,329
Actually, I told Lingze about your father

42
00:03:22,260 --> 00:03:23,860
because I wanted to help you.

43
00:03:26,600 --> 00:03:27,400
It's okay.

44
00:03:28,020 --> 00:03:30,280
So far, it seems your decision was right.

45
00:03:30,620 --> 00:03:31,600
You think so too?

46
00:03:32,420 --> 00:03:33,500
Actually,

47
00:03:34,820 --> 00:03:36,950
I think we both misunderstood Lingze.

48
00:03:40,560 --> 00:03:41,560
It's getting late.

49
00:03:41,560 --> 00:03:42,760
Go back and get some rest.

50
00:03:42,760 --> 00:03:44,220
You have to work tomorrow.

51
00:03:44,440 --> 00:03:44,820
Bye.

52
00:03:44,980 --> 00:03:45,600
Bye.

53
00:04:02,440 --> 00:04:03,200
Don't move.

54
00:04:03,500 --> 00:04:04,260
Don't move.

55
00:04:11,300 --> 00:04:12,430
It's out of battery.

56
00:04:49,420 --> 00:04:50,840
Why are you staring at me?

57
00:04:52,460 --> 00:04:55,190
These materials are some financial statistics.

58
00:04:55,360 --> 00:04:57,020
Will they be strong evidence?

59
00:05:00,560 --> 00:05:01,490
They are useful.

60
00:05:03,000 --> 00:05:05,600
But these can only serve as indirect evidence.

61
00:05:05,760 --> 00:05:08,620
Although they can make the authorities thoroughly investigate Ling Hengsheng,

62
00:05:08,620 --> 00:05:10,560
the Ling Group is deeply rooted,

63
00:05:11,400 --> 00:05:13,200
and Ling Hengsheng is ruthless.

64
00:05:13,700 --> 00:05:14,680
With just these,

65
00:05:14,780 --> 00:05:17,310
he will definitely find a loophole to escape.

66
00:05:19,560 --> 00:05:20,690
So what do you think?

67
00:05:22,760 --> 00:05:24,500
I still need more evidence.

68
00:05:26,960 --> 00:05:28,160
To be honest,

69
00:05:28,800 --> 00:05:29,860
I really don't believe that my father

70
00:05:29,860 --> 00:05:32,200
exchanged his life for only this much evidence.

71
00:05:32,200 --> 00:05:34,200
Then do you think Ling Ze

72
00:05:34,200 --> 00:05:36,460
intentionally hid important evidence?

73
00:05:37,820 --> 00:05:40,080
What would be his purpose for doing that?

74
00:05:40,300 --> 00:05:41,900
Since he already wants to use our hands

75
00:05:41,900 --> 00:05:43,100
to bring down his father,

76
00:05:43,100 --> 00:05:45,760
there is no need for him to hide anything from us.

77
00:05:47,159 --> 00:05:48,620
For now,

78
00:05:48,800 --> 00:05:50,659
Ling Ze should be fine.

79
00:05:53,620 --> 00:05:56,260
Although I still can't trust Ling Ze,

80
00:05:57,400 --> 00:05:59,400
I will support your every decision.

81
00:06:00,660 --> 00:06:01,760
Just go for it.

82
00:06:02,360 --> 00:06:03,660
No matter what happens,

83
00:06:03,660 --> 00:06:05,260
I will always be your backup.

84
00:06:08,660 --> 00:06:09,560
Thank you.

85
00:06:16,040 --> 00:06:17,770
I am reporting with my real name

86
00:06:18,100 --> 00:06:19,220
that the Ling Group

87
00:06:19,700 --> 00:06:22,030
is suspected of illegal economic crimes,

88
00:06:22,600 --> 00:06:24,020
and forces its artists

89
00:06:24,640 --> 00:06:26,300
to engage in illegal fundraising

90
00:06:26,300 --> 00:06:27,600
and prostitution.

91
00:06:51,900 --> 00:06:52,860
Wait.

92
00:06:55,659 --> 00:06:56,620
Please don't go.

93
00:06:58,040 --> 00:06:58,900
Stay with me.

94
00:07:08,860 --> 00:07:09,660
Thank you

95
00:07:10,900 --> 00:07:12,760
for saving me time and time again.

96
00:07:13,900 --> 00:07:14,680
You are like

97
00:07:15,920 --> 00:07:17,300
a guardian angel.

98
00:07:21,060 --> 00:07:22,600
No one else saved you

99
00:07:23,360 --> 00:07:24,160
but yourself.

100
00:07:25,400 --> 00:07:26,620
I am no god.

101
00:07:27,000 --> 00:07:28,460
I can't help that many people.

102
00:07:28,460 --> 00:07:29,590
My power is limited.

103
00:07:30,660 --> 00:07:32,390
I can only use it to protect you.

104
00:07:58,900 --> 00:07:59,760
In my past life,

105
00:08:00,560 --> 00:08:02,090
I was the one who harmed you.

106
00:08:03,260 --> 00:08:04,160
In this life,

107
00:08:04,760 --> 00:08:06,160
no matter the cost,

108
00:08:07,040 --> 00:08:08,300
I will make it up to you.

109
00:09:38,200 --> 00:09:38,960
Are you numb?

110
00:09:42,400 --> 00:09:43,960
I said, are you numb?

111
00:09:44,900 --> 00:09:45,760
What?

112
00:09:46,060 --> 00:09:47,990
My arm is numb. Could you move a bit?

113
00:09:57,220 --> 00:09:59,020
Women really do have two faces.

114
00:09:59,820 --> 00:10:01,420
Where are we going this time?

115
00:10:02,220 --> 00:10:03,350
To find Hao Zhenshi.

116
00:10:04,300 --> 00:10:05,220
This early?

117
00:10:06,260 --> 00:10:06,780
Yeah.

118
00:10:07,200 --> 00:10:08,700
I think finding him early

119
00:10:09,620 --> 00:10:11,620
means we can protect him in advance.

120
00:10:11,700 --> 00:10:13,620
We can also ask him about the recent changes in Lingze

121
00:10:13,620 --> 00:10:14,880
and see what he thinks.

122
00:10:17,620 --> 00:10:18,950
You've gotten smarter.

123
00:10:19,460 --> 00:10:21,120
I've always been smart, okay?

124
00:10:30,500 --> 00:10:31,120
You

125
00:10:31,700 --> 00:10:33,860
look a bit unusual today.

126
00:10:36,220 --> 00:10:37,800
What's different?

127
00:10:40,860 --> 00:10:42,060
Do you

128
00:10:43,560 --> 00:10:44,290
have a fever?

129
00:10:44,920 --> 00:10:45,860
I'm leaving.

130
00:11:28,420 --> 00:11:29,400
By the way.

131
00:11:30,020 --> 00:11:31,060
Sorry.

132
00:11:32,700 --> 00:11:33,500
What's

133
00:11:34,560 --> 00:11:35,420
wrong with you?

134
00:11:36,700 --> 00:11:37,500
What's wrong?

135
00:11:38,220 --> 00:11:39,100
Nothing.

136
00:11:41,740 --> 00:11:43,000
I just want to remind you

137
00:11:43,000 --> 00:11:44,260
that once we go in,

138
00:11:44,400 --> 00:11:45,960
you'd better keep your distance from him

139
00:11:45,960 --> 00:11:48,420
in case he has a sudden episode and hurts you.

140
00:11:49,760 --> 00:11:50,600
Got it.

141
00:11:53,360 --> 00:11:55,400
Are you sure you're okay?

142
00:11:58,000 --> 00:11:58,800
I'm fine.

143
00:12:05,280 --> 00:12:06,600
Hurry!
